I2C Data Register (I2DAT)
-------------------------

* This register contains the data to be transmitted or the data is just recieved.

	Program
	-------

	I2DAT = 0xB0; // SA + W | Memory address | Data 

	I2CONCLR = (1 << 3);	// SI = 0

	while ((( I2CONSET >> 3) & 1) == 0);


	When the Slave address is matched or not the SI flag will set.


Status Code in I2C Programming 
------------------------------

	* Status code is nothing but code generated by I2C peripheral for every action :- status code 

	* The status code is stored in the I2STAT register 

	* So by reading the status code we can identify the status 


	For example : 

		0x08 :- A start condtion has been transmitted 

